<title>THAILAND: Thai 1996 rice exports reach 5.29 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Thai 1996 rice exports reach 5.29 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai rice exports fell to 5.29 million tonnes in 1996 from 6.19 million in 1995 but bullish rice prices last year raised foreign exchange earnings made by the commodity, a commerce ministry official said.</p>
<p>She said rice exports fetched 49.07 billion baht ($1.96 billion) in 1996 against 47.12 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>Asian countries, led by China, Hong Kong, the Philippines, Singapore and Indonesia, were major buyers of Thai rice last year.</p>
<p>The commerce ministry has projected Thai rice exports to reach at least five million tonnes in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
